    """
                 Whether this candidate has enough to say that a plain summary line would be misleading, so
                 the row offers its detail behind an expander instead of either burying it or shouting it.

                 True when ports came across but not all of them, when the port people connect on is one of
    the ones that moved, or when settings were read but some could not be. Each of those needs a
    sentence rather than a tick, and a row that needs a sentence should say so and let the user
    open it.
    """


